                        "form": "habitués"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ec34b11-058a-3f2d-ac94-74960b676578",
                        "entry_id": "eb5eee07-d779-3c5d-a4a7-2f91c3a30ec6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who frequents a place."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec30bdb9-f66a-436c-aac2-266b3ece3610",
                                "sense_id": "1ec34b11-058a-3f2d-ac94-74960b676578",
                                "text": "Indeed, many guests even became habitués in order to blaze a trail with reckless abandon seven days a week."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20f6f2e5-a99a-4727-b756-284e1df2b0cb",
                                "sense_id": "1ec34b11-058a-3f2d-ac94-74960b676578",
                                "text": "A month ago the new smoking ban turned thousands of bar-room habitués into reluctant exiles from their usual corner seat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f49295b7-a5ed-4da7-9f7b-8910f9debda3",
                                "sense_id": "1ec34b11-058a-3f2d-ac94-74960b676578",
                                "text": "At half-past nine on this Saturday evening, the parlour of the Salutation Inn, High Holborn, contained most of its customary visitors.[…]In former days every tavern of repute kept such a room for its own select circle, a club, or society, of habitués, who met every evening, for a pipe and a cheerful glass."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5d0a470-02bd-40d7-b7db-601c960b22c8",
                                "sense_id": "1ec34b11-058a-3f2d-ac94-74960b676578",
                                "text": "The live circuit's arenas and stadiums, its enormodomes, are flourishing. I am a habitué of them, particularly the O2 Arena."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44674e3b-1581-3c7d-b1cf-a1de5b683563",
                        "entry_id": "eb5eee07-d779-3c5d-a4a7-2f91c3a30ec6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A devotee."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
